                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trend",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f1d4f266-22ba-3461-929d-4a4b229b231d",
                                        "entry_id": "36d54a65-5a66-3f09-8d81-d130c74fd98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inclination in a particular direction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c46e4b25-d8cb-4e02-9f84-0589744fb775",
                                                "sense_id": "f1d4f266-22ba-3461-929d-4a4b229b231d",
                                                "text": "the trend of a coastline"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea860378-8783-4ff3-91d2-36348b0384d1",
                                                "sense_id": "f1d4f266-22ba-3461-929d-4a4b229b231d",
                                                "text": "the upward trend of stock-market prices"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cebcd5f4-1776-4df8-a079-9e34b2ca984c",
                                                "sense_id": "f1d4f266-22ba-3461-929d-4a4b229b231d",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, it is clear that the global energy demand for air-conditioning will grow substantially as nations become more affluent,[…]. This trend will put additional strain not only on global energy resources but also on the environmental prospects of a warming planet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6dd62ac8-6653-3887-b4a9-060899ed5c9a",
                                        "entry_id": "36d54a65-5a66-3f09-8d81-d130c74fd98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A tendency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b3bbad6-cd2f-46e2-894a-c7cff813575e",
                                                "sense_id": "6dd62ac8-6653-3887-b4a9-060899ed5c9a",
                                                "text": "There is a trend, these days, for people in films not to smoke."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b02141ec-1e49-327e-a12f-86003fbe1b53",
                                        "entry_id": "36d54a65-5a66-3f09-8d81-d130c74fd98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fad or fashion style."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0882fd9-2a8a-4245-8ba3-a02b686c0510",
                                                "sense_id": "b02141ec-1e49-327e-a12f-86003fbe1b53",
                                                "text": "Miniskirts were one of the biggest trends of the 1960s."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5522c3f6-7c9b-4267-a32e-628acf79e142",
                                                "sense_id": "b02141ec-1e49-327e-a12f-86003fbe1b53",
                                                "text": "To stay on top of what's happening, a good photographer has to follow the trends by watching what's being done in fashion magazines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f816c2f0-7653-4bfe-bf09-92a686f980c7",
                                                "sense_id": "b02141ec-1e49-327e-a12f-86003fbe1b53",
                                                "text": "But musical ancestry aside, the influence to which Bieber is most beholden is the current trends in pop music, which means Believe is loaded up with EDM accouterments, seeking a comfortable middle ground where Bieber’s impressively refined pop-R&B croon can rub up on techno blasts and garish dubstep drops (and occasionally grind on some AutoTune, not necessarily because it needs it, but because a certain amount of robo-voice is expected these days)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a8970e3-a62d-3127-9939-7310ef038ed3",
                                        "entry_id": "36d54a65-5a66-3f09-8d81-d130c74fd98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A line drawn on a graph that approximates the trend of a number of disparate points."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c898df67-08af-32c3-b0a7-9b218ec27293",
                                        "entry_id": "36d54a65-5a66-3f09-8d81-d130c74fd98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The lower end of the shank of an anchor, being the same distance on the shank from the throat that the arm measures from the throat to the bill."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc183f9e-fb7f-3433-83af-ce39b603ad66",
                                        "entry_id": "36d54a65-5a66-3f09-8d81-d130c74fd98d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The angle made by the line of a vessel's keel and the direction of the anchor cable, when she is swinging at anchor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "trend",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7056fd83-a0dd-304d-8b9e-4846deed9ca0",
                                        "entry_id": "0b7f03e3-a4e0-364f-982d-df87d1e632b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To have a particular direction; to run; to stretch; to tend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f8bb532-de1e-4265-9a07-db058d7a00a4",
                                                "sense_id": "7056fd83-a0dd-304d-8b9e-4846deed9ca0",
                                                "text": "The shore of the sea trends to the southwest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b1da3e0-7ead-4a04-b054-193db13f9b39",
                                                "sense_id": "7056fd83-a0dd-304d-8b9e-4846deed9ca0",
                                                "text": "Huntsman starts out with a vision of Theron that’s specific, unique, and weighted in character, but it trends throughout toward generic fantasy tropes and black-and-white morality, and climaxes in a thoroughly familiar face-off."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ee45ace-1fac-34b2-94cb-39f32d8aa545",
                                        "entry_id": "0b7f03e3-a4e0-364f-982d-df87d1e632b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause to turn; to bend."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e614168-14a4-4f71-9881-b97b7d4a3b21",
                                                "sense_id": "1ee45ace-1fac-34b2-94cb-39f32d8aa545",
                                                "text": "Not farre beneath i' the Valley as ſhe trends / Her ſiluer ſtreame, ſome VVood-nymphs and her friends / That follovv'd to her aide, beholding hovv / The Brooke came gliding, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "276e1edf-d483-314f-824b-acb364180622",
                                        "entry_id": "0b7f03e3-a4e0-364f-982d-df87d1e632b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be the subject of a trend; to be currently popular, relevant or interesting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae8ebb3b-a8aa-454d-b0b0-f83a32ab2689",
                                                "sense_id": "276e1edf-d483-314f-824b-acb364180622",
                                                "text": "What topics have been trending on social networks this week?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aed8cdb7-3d06-400f-ac58-1fedf6a91832",
                                                "sense_id": "276e1edf-d483-314f-824b-acb364180622",
                                                "text": "\"Puppy Bowl\" was even a trending sports topic on Facebook."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "486da760-9761-42e3-8efa-85378b9b0813",
                                                "sense_id": "276e1edf-d483-314f-824b-acb364180622",
                                                "text": "The hashtag #RepublicofThailand trended on Twitter in Thailand on Friday after parliament voted to push back the question of changing the constitution as protesters have demanded."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba43be56-15cb-4d38-b800-a1f79b33e3d1",
                                                "sense_id": "276e1edf-d483-314f-824b-acb364180622",
                                                "text": "The platform, founded in 2006, also came along just as TV’s cultural cachet was rising, with a growth in ambitious, talk-about-able appointment series. “Mad Men” and “Breaking Bad” premiered during its run; twist-heavy serials like “Scandal” and “Game of Thrones” delivered the kind of OMG moments that got them trending regularly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
